 q('written','transfer','wheel-threshold','A wheel point has height H(t) metres for time t seconds. During one cycle 0≤t≤8, when is it strictly above 4 m? Derive the interval and interpret its endpoints.｜輪上點在時間 t 秒的高度為 H(t) 米。在一周 0≤t≤8，何時嚴格高於 4 米？推導區間並解釋端點。','H(t)=3+2§sin(§pi t/4)',null,['Translate height into a sine threshold and track the time-to-angle scale.｜把高度轉為正弦門檻，追蹤時間至角的比例。','sin θ>1/2 between π/6 and 5π/6.｜sin θ>1/2 在 π/6 與 5π/6 之間。'],[['Express the strict phase interval.｜表示嚴格相角區間。','§pi/6<§pi t/4<5§pi/6'],['Convert back to seconds and exclude equality times.｜換回秒並排除等號時刻。','2/3<t<10/3']],'Strictly above 4 m for t∈(2/3,10/3) s.｜t∈(2/3,10/3) 秒時嚴格高於 4 米。','At both endpoints the point is exactly 4 m high, so neither endpoint is included.｜兩端點恰高 4 米，故兩端均不包含。',['Model valid for 0≤t≤8 s; upward height measured from the same datum.｜模型在 0≤t≤8 秒適用；高度從同一基準向上量。'])
