 'sine-cosine':'√3/2 is cosine of 30°; sine uses the vertical coordinate 1/2.｜√3/2 是 30° 的餘弦；正弦用垂直坐標 1/2。',
 'angle-is-value':'π/6 is an angle measure, whereas sine returns its unit-circle vertical coordinate.｜π/6 是角量；正弦回傳單位圓垂直坐標。',
 'quarter-turn':'Sine equals 1 at a quarter-turn π/2, not at π/6.｜正弦在四分之一周 π/2 為 1，不在 π/6。',
 'sine-additive':'Sine is not additive: the two cross terms of the angle-sum identity are needed.｜正弦不具加法性；需要和角式的兩交叉項。',
 'angle-not-added':'The two angles add to 60° before evaluating sine.｜求正弦前兩角先相加為 60°。',
