 'cancel-fills-hole':'The original denominator is zero; a simplified formula cannot supply its missing value.｜原分母為零；化簡式不能補回缺值。',
 'zero-over-zero-one':'0/0 has no defined real quotient, so it cannot be assigned 1.｜0/0 沒有已定義實商，不能指定為 1。',
