 'phase-not-divided':'Factor out ω=2; the actual horizontal distance is phase divided by frequency.｜提出 ω=2；實際水平距離為相位除以頻率。',
 'phase-direction':'The plus sign inside x+π/6 corresponds to a leftward shift.｜x+π/6 內加號對應左移。',
 'phase-vertical':'A term inside the sine changes the input phase; vertical shift is added outside.｜正弦內的項改輸入相位；垂直平移加在外部。',
 'all-sines-period':'The function is constant, so every positive shift works and none is least.｜函數為常數，所有正平移均成立，沒有最小者。',
 'zero-positive':'Zero is not positive; moreover every positive candidate can be halved.｜零不是正數；而任何正候選值都可再減半。',
